      "message": "This mirrors the current behavior that only looks at the service record, but actually any of the records could expire. For example if any of the address records expire, it should be removed and an update callback should be sent, so the app knows that one of the addresses is now unusable.\n\nBut you could add support for other records in another change since this matches previous behavior",
